Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] sync: authenticate and install eCash UTXO state with reverse
 validation

Add 256-shard Merklix UTXO state synchronization anchored by Avalanche
quorum state commitments.

Original-Commit: b93d59944e56a4b4e13ee29f174e4633dcb8dae4
Original-Patch: ecash/016
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Candidate-Repair: Complete the first eCash state-sync engine owner with exact legacy-script state coins, quorum-authenticated anchors, atomic durable pivot installation, conservative restart provenance, and full ABC reverse validation. Six native regressions and coins_tests passed before fold; source clean replay and runtime gates remain required. Transport is retained in the next purposeful patch; later duplicate engine catch-up is absorbed into its owners.

